#. report analytical narrative
msgid "About the Search Results Report"
msgstr "O izvješću o rezultatima pretraživanja"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Lists the files that match your criteria at one moment, states how many matched in "
"total and says so when the list is shortened."
msgstr ""
"Navodi datoteke koje u jednom trenutku odgovaraju vašim kriterijima, navodi ukupan "
"broj podudaranja i upozorava kada je popis skraćen."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "About the Distinctive Terms Report"
msgstr "O izvješću o razlikovnim pojmovima"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Compares how often each word occurs in the documents you selected with the rest of "
"the collection you may see, and lists the words whose difference is statistically "
"reliable."
msgstr ""
"Uspoređuje koliko se često svaka riječ pojavljuje u dokumentima koje ste odabrali s "
"ostatkom zbirke koji smijete vidjeti i navodi riječi čija je razlika statistički "
"pouzdana."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "About the Keyword Intelligence Report"
msgstr "O obavještajnom izvještaju o ključnim riječima"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Shows each keyword's reach within the contents your criteria matched: how many "
"contents contain it, how often it occurs, and its category. Keywords are listed even "
"when nothing matches them."
msgstr ""
"Prikazuje doseg svake ključne riječi unutar sadržaja koje su vaši kriteriji označili:"
" koliko sadržaja je sadrži, koliko se puta pojavljuje i njenu kategoriju. Ključne "
"riječi navode se čak i kada im ništa ne odgovara."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "About the Category Analysis Report"
msgstr "O izvještaju analize kategorija"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Shows, for each category, how many of the matched contents contain at least one of "
"its words, how often those words occur, and the share of the matched set. Because "
"categories can share words, contents are counted in every category that applies and "
"shares are per category, not a partition."
msgstr ""
"Za svaku kategoriju prikazuje koliko odgovarajućih sadržaja sadrži barem jednu od "
"njenih riječi, koliko se te riječi pojavljuju i udio u odgovarajućem skupu. Budući da"
" kategorije mogu dijeliti riječi, sadržaji se broje u svakoj kategoriji na koju se "
"odnose, a udjeli se računaju po svakoj kategoriji posebno i nisu potpuna podjela."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "About the Horizon Report"
msgstr "O izvještaju horizonta"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Lists the dates and relative references detected in the matched documents - when "
"something is promised or expected to happen - grouped by how soon it arrives relative"
" to the reference date you choose: overdue, this week, this month, this quarter, and "
"later. Undated references and purely past mentions are not part of the horizon."
msgstr ""
"Navodi datume i relativne reference otkrivene u odgovarajućim dokumentima - kada se "
"nešto obećava ili očekuje - grupirane prema tome koliko brzo dolaze u odnosu na "
"referentni datum koji odaberete: zakasnjelo, ovaj tjedan, ovaj mjesec, ovaj kvartal i"
" kasnije. Nedatirane reference i spominjanja koja su isključivo prošlost nisu dio "
"horizonta."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "About the Scenario Outcome Report"
msgstr "O izvještaju ishoda scenarija"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Shows what one scenario decided: per content, the outcomes it was classified into, "
"the cases that matched, what its previous outcomes were, and whether the result was "
"only recorded or also notified, with the derived priority and its basis. History is "
"never overwritten - each evaluation's results stay exactly as they were recorded. A "
"scenario's outcomes are visible to its owner and to administrators."
msgstr ""
"Prikazuje što je jedan scenarij odlučio: po sadržaju, u koje je ishode razvrstao, "
"koji su se slučaji podudarali, koji su mu bili prethodni ishodi, te je li ishod samo "
"zabilježen ili je poslana i obavijest, s izvedenim prioritetom i njegovom osnovom. "
"Povijest se nikada ne prepisuje - rezultati svake procjene ostaju točno onakvi kakvi "
"su zabilježeni. Ishodi scenarija vidljivi su njegovom vlasniku i administratorima."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "About the Comprehensive Intelligence Report"
msgstr "O sveobuhvatnom izvještaju obavještajnih podataka"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Combines the matched-set overview, the distinctive terms and the keyword and category"
" reach into one report of sections: what was selected, how it differs from the rest "
"of the collection, and which stored keywords and categories it uses. Every section "
"keeps its own measures, findings, confidence, consequence and caveat, and every count"
" states whether it is exact or a shortened listing."
msgstr ""
"Objedinjuje pregled skupa podudaranja, istaknute pojmove i dosez ključnih riječi i "
"kategorija u jedan izvještaj s odjeljcima: što je odabrano, po čemu se razlikuje od "
"ostatka zbirke i koje spremljene ključne riječi i kategorije koristi. Svaki odjeljak "
"zadržava svoje mjere, nalaze, pouzdanost, posljedice i upozorenja, a svako "
"prebrojavanje navodi je li točno ili skraćeni popis."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "About the Change Report"
msgstr "O izvještaju o promjenama"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Shows what changed in the matched set since you last ran this view: added documents, "
"and recorded modifications and removals with the moment each was detected, what the "
"values were before, and what they became. Your watermark is kept per view, per "
"reader, and never moves backwards; running the report marks its events seen. Removals"
" appear when a removal operation records them - until then the empty list means none "
"were recorded."
msgstr ""
"Prikazuje što se promijenilo u pronađenom skupu od posljednjeg pokretanja ovog "
"pregleda: dodane dokumente te zabilježene izmjene i uklanjanja s trenutkom otkrivanja"
" svake, vrijednostima prije i onim poslije. Vaš se vodeni žig čuva po pregledu i po "
"čitatelju i nikada se ne vraća unatrag; pokretanje izvještaja označava njegove "
"događaje viđenima. Uklanjanja se pojavljuju kada ih operacija uklanjanja zabilježi - "
"do tada prazan popis znači da nijedno nije zabilježeno."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "About the Latest Entries Report"
msgstr "O izvještaju najnovijih unosa"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Lists the matched documents newest first and tells you, per row, whether it is new "
"since you last looked at this view or something you have already seen. Recently "
"ingested documents are marked alongside, whatever their reading state: a document can"
" be both. Your progress is kept per view, per reader - two readers never share it, "
"and it never moves backwards."
msgstr ""
"Navodi pronađene dokumente najnovije prve i govori vam, za svaki redak, je li nov od "
"posljednji put kada ste pogledali ovaj pregled ili nešto što ste već vidjeli. Nedavno"
" primljeni dokumenti označeni su uz to, bez obzira na stanje čitanja: dokument može "
"biti oboje. Vaš napredak čuva se po pregledu i po čitatelju - dva čitatelja ga nikada"
" ne dijele i on se nikada ne vraća unatrag."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "About the Content Relationships Report"
msgstr "O izvještaju o odnosima sadržaja"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Shows which contents appear in more than one source or side: every context of the "
"matched contents with its file count, and the number of sibling contexts and sibling "
"sources sharing the identical content. Repeated copies in the same source-and-side "
"are one context, not several."
msgstr ""
"Prikazuje koji se sadržaji pojavljuju u više od jednog izvora ili strane: svaki "
"kontekst odgovarajućih sadržaja s brojem datoteka te broj sestrinskih konteksta i "
"sestrinskih izvora koji dijele identičan sadržaj. Ponovljene kopije u istom "
"izvoru-i-strani jedan su kontekst, ne više njih."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "About the Entity & Place Report"
msgstr "O izvještaju o entitetima i mjestima"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Lists every place from the gazetteer that the detector found in the matched "
"documents, with how often it was identified and how often the mention stayed "
"ambiguous - the text could mean this place or another one (Tripoli, Georgia). "
"Ambiguous mentions are never counted as identified: you see both, side by side."
msgstr ""
"Navodi svako mjesto iz pojmovnika koje je detektor pronašao u odgovarajućim "
"dokumentima, koliko je puta identificirano i koliko je puta spominjanje ostalo "
"dvosmisleno - tekst može značiti ovo mjesto ili neko drugo (Tripoli, Gruzija). "
"Dvosmislena spominjanja nikada se ne broje kao identificirana: vidite oba, jedno uz "
"drugo."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "About the Full Entry Report"
msgstr "O potpunom izvješću unosa"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Produces a printable dossier of the files your criteria select: each entry's stored "
"identity, the source and side and analyst categories assigned to it, and the full "
"extracted text. The readable HTML uses a dedicated template with one section per "
"entry, ready to print. A shortened listing or a shortened text is stated, never "
"hidden."
msgstr ""
"Izrađuje ispisivi dosje datoteka koje tvoji kriteriji odaberu: pohranjeni identitet "
"svakog unosa, izvor, stranu i analitičke kategorije te cijeli izdvojeni tekst. "
"Čitljivi HTML koristi namjenski predložak s jednim odjeljkom po unosu, spreman za "
"ispis. Skraćeni popis ili tekst navede se, nikad ne skriva."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "Distinctive terms"
msgstr "Razlikovni pojmovi"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Keyness compares stored word forms. It does not merge inflections, synonyms or "
"languages, so a selection in another language than the collection shows its function "
"words. Next step: open the documents that contain the top terms."
msgstr ""
"Ključnost uspoređuje pohranjene oblike riječi. Ne spaja fleksije, sinonime ni jezike,"
" pa odabir na drugom jeziku od zbirke pokazuje svoje funkcionalne riječi. Sljedeći "
"korak: otvorite dokumente koji sadrže najistaknutije pojmove."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "Next step: widen the criteria, or check that the matching documents were processed."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeći korak: proširite kriterije ili provjerite jesu li odgovarajući dokumenti "
"obrađeni."

#. report analytical narrative
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Keyness compares stored word forms. It does not merge inflections, synonyms or "
"languages. %(unknown_rows)s word records without a count were left out of every "
"total. Next step: open the documents that contain the top terms."
msgstr ""
"Ključnost uspoređuje pohranjene oblike riječi. Ne spaja fleksije, sinonime ni jezike."
" %(unknown_rows)s zapisa riječi bez broja izostavljeno je iz svih zbrojeva. Sljedeći "
"korak: otvorite dokumente koji sadrže najistaknutije pojmove."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "No statistical test was performed."
msgstr "Nije proveden nijedan statistički test."

#. report analytical narrative
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Only terms with G2 of at least %(critical)s count as findings (p < 0.0001; "
"%(source)s). Every term in the vocabulary is tested, so the weaker significance "
"levels are not treated as findings."
msgstr ""
"Samo pojmovi s G2 od najmanje %(critical)s smatraju se nalazima (p < 0.0001; "
"%(source)s). Testira se svaki pojam u rječniku, pa se slabije razine značajnosti ne "
"smatraju nalazima."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Any difference between the selection and the collection is not in word frequency at "
"this level; categories, sources or dates may show one."
msgstr ""
"Eventualna razlika između odabira i zbirke nije u učestalosti riječi na ovoj razini; "
"mogu je pokazati kategorije, izvori ili datumi."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "No conclusion can be drawn from this section."
msgstr "Iz ovog odjeljka ne može se izvesti nikakav zaključak."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"These terms characterise the selection against the rest of the collection. They show "
"where it differs, not why: read the documents that contain them before drawing "
"conclusions."
msgstr ""
"Ovi pojmovi obilježavaju odabir u odnosu na ostatak zbirke. Pokazuju gdje se "
"razlikuje, a ne zašto: pročitajte dokumente koji ih sadrže prije donošenja "
"zaključaka."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"The matching contents are the whole visible collection, so there is no reference to "
"compare them with."
msgstr ""
"Odgovarajući sadržaji čine cijelu vidljivu zbirku, pa nema referentnog skupa za "
"usporedbu."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "No visible content matches the criteria, so there is nothing to compare."
msgstr "Nijedan vidljivi sadržaj ne odgovara kriterijima, pa nema što usporediti."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "The matching contents have no counted words, so keyness cannot be measured."
msgstr "Odgovarajući sadržaji nemaju prebrojenih riječi, pa se ključnost ne može izmjeriti."

#. report analytical narrative
#, python-format
msgid ""
"No term reaches G2 %(critical)s: at this level the selection's word frequencies do "
"not differ from the rest of the collection."
msgstr ""
"Nijedan pojam ne doseže G2 od %(critical)s: na ovoj se razini učestalosti riječi u "
"odabiru ne razlikuju od ostatka zbirke."

#. report analytical narrative
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(significant)s terms are used significantly more often in the selection than in the "
"rest of the collection (G2 of at least %(critical)s). The strongest is "
"\"%(top_term)s\": G2 %(top_g2)s, Log Ratio %(top_log_ratio)s."
msgstr ""
"Pojmova koji se u odabiru koriste značajno češće nego u ostatku zbirke: "
"%(significant)s (G2 najmanje %(critical)s). Najjači je „%(top_term)s”: G2 %(top_g2)s,"
" logaritamski omjer %(top_log_ratio)s."

#. report analytical narrative
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(significant)s terms are used significantly less often in the selection than in the "
"rest of the collection (G2 of at least %(critical)s). The strongest is "
"\"%(top_term)s\": G2 %(top_g2)s, Log Ratio %(top_log_ratio)s."
msgstr ""
"Pojmova koji se u odabiru koriste značajno rjeđe nego u ostatku zbirke: "
"%(significant)s (G2 najmanje %(critical)s). Najjači je „%(top_term)s”: G2 %(top_g2)s,"
" logaritamski omjer %(top_log_ratio)s."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Log-likelihood keyness (G2) compares word frequencies in the selected contents with "
"the other visible contents."
msgstr ""
"Ključnost po log-vjerodostojnosti (G2) uspoređuje učestalosti riječi u odabranim "
"sadržajima s ostalim vidljivim sadržajima."

#. report analytical narrative
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Log-likelihood keyness (G2) and Log Ratio compare %(target_tokens)s counted words in "
"%(target_contents)s selected contents with %(reference_tokens)s words in the other "
"%(reference_contents)s visible contents. Listed: the %(shown)s terms used more often "
"in the selection, highest G2 first."
msgstr ""
"Ključnost (G2) i logaritamski omjer uspoređuju %(target_tokens)s prebrojenih riječi u"
" %(target_contents)s odabranih sadržaja s %(reference_tokens)s riječi u ostalih "
"%(reference_contents)s vidljivih sadržaja. Navedeno: %(shown)s pojmova češće "
"korištenih u odabiru, od najvećeg G2."

#. report analytical narrative
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Log-likelihood keyness (G2) and Log Ratio compare %(target_tokens)s counted words in "
"%(target_contents)s selected contents with %(reference_tokens)s words in the other "
"%(reference_contents)s visible contents. Listed: the %(shown)s terms used less often "
"in the selection, highest G2 first."
msgstr ""
"Ključnost (G2) i logaritamski omjer uspoređuju %(target_tokens)s prebrojenih riječi u"
" %(target_contents)s odabranih sadržaja s %(reference_tokens)s riječi u ostalih "
"%(reference_contents)s vidljivih sadržaja. Navedeno: %(shown)s pojmova rjeđe "
"korištenih u odabiru, od najvećeg G2."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "Next step: open the documents that contain the top terms."
msgstr "Sljedeći korak: otvorite dokumente koji sadrže najistaknutije pojmove."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Keyness compares stored word forms. It does not merge inflections, synonyms or "
"languages, so a selection in another language than the collection shows its function "
"words."
msgstr ""
"Ključnost uspoređuje pohranjene oblike riječi. Ne spaja fleksije, sinonime ni jezike,"
" pa odabir na drugom jeziku od zbirke pokazuje svoje funkcionalne riječi."

#. report analytical narrative
#, python-format
msgid "The strongest is \"%(top_term)s\": G2 %(top_g2)s, Log Ratio %(top_log_ratio)s."
msgstr "Najjači je „%(top_term)s”: G2 %(top_g2)s, logaritamski omjer %(top_log_ratio)s."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Log-likelihood keyness (G2) and Log Ratio compare the word frequencies of the "
"selected contents with those of the other visible contents."
msgstr ""
"Ključnost (G2) i logaritamski omjer uspoređuju učestalosti riječi u odabranim "
"sadržajima s onima u ostalim vidljivim sadržajima."

#. report analytical narrative
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Contents in the selection: %(target_contents)s; counted words: %(target_tokens)s. "
"Contents in the rest of the collection: %(reference_contents)s; counted words: "
"%(reference_tokens)s."
msgstr ""
"Sadržaji u odabiru: %(target_contents)s; prebrojene riječi: %(target_tokens)s. "
"Sadržaji u ostatku zbirke: %(reference_contents)s; prebrojene riječi: "
"%(reference_tokens)s."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "Matched Set Overview"
msgstr "Pregled skupa podudaranja"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "Next step: widen the criteria, or check that the matching files were processed."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeći korak: proširite kriterije ili provjerite jesu li podudarne datoteke "
"obrađene."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Categories can share words, so one content can carry several categories, and a "
"content can carry many keywords. Sources are counted distinctly: one source with many"
" file occurrences counts once."
msgstr ""
"Kategorije mogu dijeliti riječi, pa jedan sadržaj može pripadati više kategorija i "
"nositi mnogo ključnih riječi. Izvori se broje zasebno: jedan izvor s mnogo "
"pojavljivanja datoteka broji se jednom."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"These counts are exact for the matched set: the overview is a single measured row, "
"not a listing, so nothing is shortened and nothing is estimated."
msgstr ""
"Ova su prebrojavanja točna za skup podudaranja: pregled je jedan izmjereni redak, a "
"ne popis, pa ništa nije skraćeno i ništa nije procijenjeno."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "No count was performed."
msgstr "Nije izvršeno nikakvo prebrojavanje."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"These facts describe the matched set only. The sections that follow measure how its "
"terms and categories differ from the rest of the collection."
msgstr ""
"Ove činjenice opisuju samo skup podudaranja. Sljedeći odjeljci mjere po čemu se "
"njegovi pojmovi i kategorije razlikuju od ostatka zbirke."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "No visible content matches the criteria, so there is nothing to describe."
msgstr "Nema vidljivog sadržaja koji odgovara kriterijima, pa nema što opisati."

#. report analytical narrative
#, python-format
msgid ""
"File dates: %(first_ingest)s to %(last_ingest)s. Event dates: %(first_event)s to "
"%(last_event)s."
msgstr ""
"Datumi datoteka: od %(first_ingest)s do %(last_ingest)s. Datumi događaja: od "
"%(first_event)s do %(last_event)s."

#. report analytical narrative
#, python-format
msgid ""
"File dates: %(first_ingest)s to %(last_ingest)s. No event date is detected in the "
"matched contents."
msgstr ""
"Datumi datoteka: od %(first_ingest)s do %(last_ingest)s. Nije otkriven datum događaja"
" u podudarnim sadržajima."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"The overview counts what the criteria select in the visible collection at one moment:"
" contents, their file occurrences, their sources, and the keywords and categories "
"present in them."
msgstr ""
"Pregled broji što kriteriji odabiru u vidljivoj zbirci u jednom trenutku: sadržaje, "
"njihova pojavljivanja datoteka, njihove izvore, te ključne riječi i kategorije "
"prisutne u njima."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "The overview counts the contents the criteria select; the criteria selected none."
msgstr "Pregled broji sadržaje koje kriteriji odabiru; kriteriji nisu odabrali nijedan."

#. report analytical narrative
#, python-format
msgid "Contents: %(contents)s. File occurrences: %(paths)s. Sources: %(sources)s."
msgstr "Sadržaji: %(contents)s. Pojavljivanja datoteka: %(paths)s. Izvori: %(sources)s."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "Keyword and Category Reach"
msgstr "Dosez ključnih riječi i kategorija"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Categories share words, so their shares are not a partition and can overlap. A "
"keyword belongs to one category; a content can contain many keywords."
msgstr ""
"Kategorije dijele riječi, pa njihovi udjeli nisu podjela i mogu se preklapati. "
"Ključna riječ pripada jednoj kategoriji; sadržaj može sadržavati mnogo ključnih "
"riječi."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Reaches are exact counts of distinct matched contents; shares are those counts "
"against the same matched set. The listings are capped prefixes, so a shortened "
"listing states its truncation."
msgstr ""
"Dosezi su točna prebrojavanja različitih podudarnih sadržaja; udjeli su ta "
"prebrojavanja prema istom skupu podudaranja. Popisi su ograničeni prefiksi, pa "
"skraćeni popis navodi svoje skraćivanje."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "No reach was measured."
msgstr "Nije izmjeren nikakav doseg."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Reach shows which stored keywords and categories the matched set uses most, not why. "
"Next step: open the contents listed by the Keyword Intelligence and Category Analysis"
" reports."
msgstr ""
"Dosez pokazuje koje spremljene ključne riječi i kategorije skup podudaranja najviše "
"koristi, ali ne i zašto. Sljedeći korak: otvorite sadržaje navedene u izvještajima "
"obavještajnih podataka o ključnim riječima i analizi kategorija."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "No visible content matches the criteria."
msgstr "Nema vidljivog sadržaja koji odgovara kriterijima."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"No keyword and no category reaches the matched contents: presence there is zero, "
"which is a measurement, not an unknown."
msgstr ""
"Nijedna ključna riječ ni kategorija ne doseže podudarne sadržaje: prisutnost tamo je "
"nula, a to je mjerenje, a ne nepoznanica."

#. report analytical narrative
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The widest category is \"%(top_category)s\": %(category_contents)s of the matched "
"contents contain at least one of its words (%(category_share)s%% of them)."
msgstr ""
"Najšira kategorija je \"%(top_category)s\": %(category_contents)s podudarnih sadržaja"
" sadrži barem jednu od njezinih riječi (%(category_share)s%% njih)."

#. report analytical narrative
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The widest keyword is \"%(top_keyword)s\": present in %(keyword_contents)s of the "
"matched contents (%(keyword_share)s%% of them); stored occurrences: "
"%(keyword_occurrences)s."
msgstr ""
"Najšira ključna riječ je \"%(top_keyword)s\": prisutna u %(keyword_contents)s "
"podudarnih sadržaja (%(keyword_share)s%% njih); spremljena pojavljivanja: "
"%(keyword_occurrences)s."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Reach measures how far the stored keywords and categories extend into the matched "
"contents: for each, how many of the matched contents contain it, and how often."
msgstr ""
"Dosez mjeri koliko se spremljene ključne riječi i kategorije protežu u podudarne "
"sadržaje: za svaku, koliko podudarnih sadržaja je sadrži i koliko često."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "Reach is measured inside the matched contents; the criteria matched none."
msgstr "Dosez se mjeri unutar podudarnih sadržaja; kriteriji nisu podudarili nijedan."

#. report analytical narrative
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Matched contents: %(contents)s. Keywords present in at least one: %(keywords)s. "
"Categories present in at least one: %(categories)s."
msgstr ""
"Podudarni sadržaji: %(contents)s. Ključne riječi prisutne u barem jednom: "
"%(keywords)s. Kategorije prisutne u barem jednom: %(categories)s."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "Horizon Profile"
msgstr "Analiza: Horizon Profile"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Next step: widen the criteria, choose another reference date, or check that the "
"matching documents were analysed by the temporal detector."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeći korak: proširite kriterije, odaberite drugi referentni datum ili provjerite "
"jesu li odgovarajući dokumenti analizirani vremenskim detektorom."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Undated references and purely past mentions are outside the horizon. Confidence and "
"method may be unknown for older stored signals. Next step: open the files that carry "
"the densest bucket."
msgstr ""
"Nedatirane reference i čisto prošla spominjanja su izvan horizonta. Pouzdanost i "
"način mogu biti nepoznati za starije pohranjene signale. Sljedeći korak: otvorite "
"datoteke koje nose najgušću kantu."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Bucket totals are exact counts of the signals listed in this run. They describe the "
"stored listing, not an estimate of the whole collection."
msgstr ""
"Zbrojevi kante točni su brojevi signala navedenih u ovoj seriji. Opisuju pohranjeni "
"oglas, a ne procjenu cijele kolekcije."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "No horizon count was performed."
msgstr "Nije provedeno brojanje obzora."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"These buckets show when the matched documents speak of forthcoming events, not why "
"those dates were written. Read the evidence sentences and open the source files "
"before drawing operational conclusions."
msgstr ""
"Ove kante prikazuju kada podudarni dokumenti govore o predstojećim događajima, a ne "
"zašto su ti datumi napisani. Pročitajte rečenice dokaza i otvorite izvorne datoteke "
"prije donošenja operativnih zaključaka."

#. report analytical narrative
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bucket counts: overdue %(overdue)s; next 7 days %(week)s; next 30 days %(month)s; "
"next 90 days %(quarter)s; later %(later)s."
msgstr ""
"Broj kanti: dospjelo %(overdue)s; sljedećih 7 dana %(week)s; sljedećih 30 dana "
"%(month)s; sljedećih 90 dana %(quarter)s; kasnije %(later)s."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "No temporal signal falls on the horizon for this selection and reference date."
msgstr "Nijedan vremenski signal ne pada na horizont za ovaj odabir i referentni datum."

#. report analytical narrative
#, python-format
msgid "The soonest listed event date is %(soonest)s; the latest is %(latest)s."
msgstr "Najraniji navedeni datum događaja je %(soonest)s; najnoviji je %(latest)s."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"The listing includes every matching horizon signal in this snapshot (the row limit "
"was not reached)."
msgstr ""
"Oglas sadrži sve signale horizonta koji se podudaraju na ovoj snimci (nije dostignuto"
" ograničenje broja redaka)."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"The horizon groups detected future-oriented dates and relative references in the "
"matched documents by how soon they fall relative to the declared reference date: "
"overdue, next 7 days, next 30 days, next 90 days, and later."
msgstr ""
"Grupe horizonata otkrile su datume orijentirane na budućnost i relativne reference u "
"odgovarajućim dokumentima prema tome koliko brzo padaju u odnosu na deklarirani "
"referentni datum: dospjelo, sljedećih 7 dana, sljedećih 30 dana, sljedećih 90 dana i "
"kasnije."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"The horizon measures future-oriented dates in the matched documents; none were listed"
" for this run."
msgstr ""
"Horizont mjeri datume usmjerene na budućnost u odgovarajućim dokumentima; nijedan "
"nije naveden za ovu vožnju."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"The listing is a capped prefix: more matching signals existed than were stored in "
"this run."
msgstr ""
"Oglas ima ograničeni prefiks: postoji više signala koji se podudaraju nego što je "
"pohranjeno u ovoj seriji."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "Place Profile"
msgstr "Analiza: Place Profile"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Next step: widen the criteria, or check that the matching documents were analysed by "
"the places detector."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeći korak: proširite kriterije ili provjerite jesu li odgovarajući dokumenti "
"analizirani detektorom mjesta."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid ""
"Unresolved mentions that name no place are outside per-place attribution. Retired "
"gazetteer entries remain listed with their flag. Next step: open the representative "
"files for the densest places."
msgstr ""
