msgstr "Datotekama u ovoj seriji nisu dodijeljene analitičke oznake kategorija."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "No keywords were assigned to files in this batch."
msgstr "Datotekama u ovoj seriji nisu dodijeljene ključne riječi."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "No detector signals were stored for this batch."
msgstr "Za ovu seriju nisu pohranjeni signali detektora."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "No place mentions were stored for this batch."
msgstr "Za ovu seriju nisu pohranjena spominjanja mjesta."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "No stored file rows were identified for this batch."
msgstr "Za ovu seriju nisu prepoznati pohranjeni retci datoteka."

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "File binding: stored path identifiers"
msgstr "Povezivanje datoteka: pohranjeni identifikatori putanje"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "File binding: recovered from the path watermark"
msgstr "Povezivanje datoteka: obnovljeno iz vodenog žiga putanje"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "File binding: recovered from source, side and the job time window"
msgstr "Povezivanje datoteka: obnovljeno iz izvora, strane i vremenskog prozora posla"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "File binding: recovered from source, side, date and intake path"
msgstr "Povezivanje datoteka: obnovljeno iz izvora, strane, datuma i putanje unosa"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "File binding: recovered from the intake path under this source and side"
msgstr "Povezivanje datoteka: obnovljeno iz putanje unosa pod ovim izvorom i stranom"

#. report analytical narrative
msgid "File binding: counts are available; individual files could not be bound"
msgstr "Povezivanje datoteka: brojevi su dostupni; pojedinačne datoteke nisu se mogle povezati"

msgid "The working overview: what is stored, what is running, what needs attention."
msgstr "Radni pregled: što je pohranjeno, što radi i što traži pažnju."

msgid ""
"Every stored object, with its content, metadata and lineage. The file detail, content"
" and full-content pages are part of this interface."
msgstr ""
"Svaki pohranjeni objekt s sadržajem, metapodacima i porijeklom. Stranice detalja, "
"sadržaja i punog sadržaja datoteke dio su sučelja."

msgid ""
"Search across stored content, with the advanced and enhanced builders and saved "
"searches as modes of the same interface."
msgstr ""
"Pretraživanje pohranjenog sadržaja, s naprednim i proširenim graditeljem te "
"spremljenim pretragama kao načinima istog sučelja."

msgid "Where material came from, and everything recorded about that origin."
msgstr "Odakle je materijal došao i sve što je zabilježeno o tom izvoru."

msgid "The parties the material belongs to."
msgstr "Strane kojima materijal pripada."

msgid "Keywords identified in the material."
msgstr "Ključne riječi prepoznate u materijalu."

msgid "The word dictionary used by extraction and classification."
msgstr "Rječnik riječi koji koriste ekstrakcija i klasifikacija."

msgid "Categories and the words assigned to them."
msgstr "Kategorije i riječi dodijeljene njima."

msgid "Words and phrases that identify e-mail material."
msgstr "Riječi i fraze koje identificiraju e-mail materijal."

msgid ""
"The analyst's own layer: categories and assignments made by hand, kept separate from "
"automatic classification."
msgstr "Sloj analitičara: ručne kategorije i dodjele, odvojene od automatske klasifikacije."

msgid ""
"What the system has to tell the operator, including similar-file and future-date "
"findings."
msgstr "Ono što sustav javlja operateru, uključujući slične datoteke i nalaze budućih datuma."

msgid ""
"Dated references on a forward-looking horizon (overdue, next 7/30/90 days, later) and"
" every stored signal - dates and places - with its evidence sentence, confidence, "
"method and detector version."
msgstr ""
"Datirane reference na vremenskom horizontu (zakašnjelo, sljedećih 7/30/90 dana, "
"kasnije) i svaki pohranjeni signal — datumi i mjesta — s rečenicom dokaza, "
"pouzdanošću, metodom i verzijom detektora."

msgid ""
"Scenarios (cases over signal and document conditions, one outcome per document, "
"mandatory dry-run before activation, append-only outcome history) and monitoring "
"rules. Notifications reach the owner only."
msgstr ""
"Scenariji (slučajevi prema uvjetima signala i dokumenata, jedan ishod po dokumentu, "
"obavezan dry-run prije aktivacije, append-only povijest) i pravila nadzora. "
"Obavijesti samo vlasniku."

msgid ""
"Bring material in - one file, a folder, or a path on the server - and follow the jobs"
" it creates. Each finished intake has a dedicated printable batch report. The old "
"/upload page redirects here."
msgstr ""
"Unos materijala — datoteka, mapa ili put na poslužitelju — i praćenje stvorenih "
"poslova. Svaki dovršeni unos ima vlastito ispisivo izvješće serije. Stari /upload "
"preusmjerava ovdje."

msgid "Structured imports: validate, preview and resolve before anything is stored."
msgstr "Strukturirani uvoz: provjera, pregled i rješavanje prije pohrane."

msgid ""
"The archive of everything stored, organised by source, side and hash, and the entry "
"point to the analysis workspaces."
msgstr "Arhiv svega pohranjenog, po izvoru, strani i hash-u, i ulaz u radne prostore analize."

msgid "How material is arranged on disk: directories, trees and their contents."
msgstr "Kako je materijal raspoređen na disku: mape, stabla i sadržaj."

msgid "Map Viewer"
msgstr "Preglednik karte"

msgid ""
"Browse geotagged files on offline or online basemaps; download map packages into the "
"project for use without network access."
msgstr ""
"Pregledavajte geooznačene datoteke na offline ili online osnovnim kartama; preuzmite "
"pakete karte u projekt za rad bez mreže."

msgid "Process many objects at once, with the outcome of every run recorded as a job."
msgstr "Obrada mnogih objekata odjednom, ishod svakog pokretanja zabilježen kao posao."

msgid "What the material is: classification outcomes across the stored objects."
msgstr "Što je materijal: ishodi klasifikacije pohranjenih objekata."

msgid "Detailed reporting over what is stored and what has been processed."
msgstr "Detaljno izvještavanje o pohranjenom i obrađenom."

msgid ""
"Registered, versioned reports: choose one, give its parameters (or a saved search), "
"run it as a background job and read the result - every dataset from one database "
"snapshot, with counts and any shortening stated. The Full Entry Report and its live "
"printable dossier belong here."
msgstr ""
"Registrirana verzionirana izvješća: odaberite, zadajte parametre (ili spremljenu "
"pretragu), pokrenite u pozadini i pročitajte rezultat — svaki skup iz jednog snimka "
"baze s brojevima i navedenim skraćivanjem. Potpuno izvješće zapisa i njegov živi "
"ispisivi dosje pripadaju ovamo."

msgid ""
"The reporting system at a glance: the report versions your role can read, the runs by"
" measured outcome (yours, or everyone's for an administrator), the artifacts made "
"from them, and the schedules that fire next. Every number is counted from the stored "
"runs - never assumed."
msgstr ""
"Sustav izvještavanja na prvi pogled: verzije po ulozi, pokretanja po ishodu (vaša ili"
" sva za admina), artefakti i sljedeći rasporedi. Svaki broj iz pohranjenih pokretanja"
" — nikad pretpostavljeno."

msgid ""
"The pruning policies for everything that grows: finished jobs, the rule ledger and "
"evaluation log, scenario outcomes, notifications, report runs and artifacts, the "
"revision log and the audit log - each with an explicit keep-forever default where "
"pruning would destroy evidence. Every applied prune is audited with its count."
msgstr ""
"Pravila obrezivanja za sve što raste: završeni poslovi, knjiga pravila i dnevnik "
"evaluacije, ishodi scenarija, obavijesti, pokretanja izvješća i artefakti, revizijski"
" i audit dnevnik — zadrži zauvijek gdje bi obrezivanje uništilo dokaze. Svako "
"obrezivanje auditirano s brojem."

msgid ""
"Run a registered report, or evaluate every active rule / scenario, on an interval. "
"Each fire re-checks the owner's role and the payload before anything runs; a schedule"
" that can no longer run is disabled with the reason stated."
msgstr ""
"Pokreni registrirano izvješće ili procijeni svako aktivno pravilo/scenarij u "
"intervalu. Svako okidanje ponovno provjerava ulogu vlasnika i payload; raspored koji "
"ne može raditi onemogućen s razlogom."

msgid "The same stored material presented as charts and timelines."
msgstr "Isti pohranjeni materijal prikazan kao grafikoni i vremenske crte."

msgid ""
"Which detector version analysed which content, with what outcome: coverage per "
"detector, content never analysed or analysed by an older version, failed runs with "
"their error, and re-detection as a background job."
msgstr ""
"Koja verzija detektora analizirala koji sadržaj i s kojim ishodom: pokrivenost po "
"detektoru, sadržaj nikad analiziran ili starom verzijom, neuspjela pokretanja s "
"greškom i ponovno otkrivanje u pozadini."

msgid ""
"Every long-running operation: what it is doing, what it did, and the event stream "
"behind it. This is the system of record for processing."
msgstr ""
"Svaka dugotrajna operacija: što radi, što je učinila i tok događaja iza nje. Sustavni"
" zapis obrade."

msgid ""
"The earlier one-page console for batch import, database backups and settings "
"exchange. Superseded by the Import Center and Settings; kept working until everything"
" it does has moved."
msgstr ""
"Ranija konzola za skupni uvoz, sigurnosne kopije baze i razmjenu postavki. "
"Zamijenjena Import centrom i Postavkama; radi dok se sve ne premjesti."

msgid "People who may sign in, the roles they hold and the sessions they are using."
msgstr "Osobe koje se mogu prijaviti, njihove uloge i sesije."

msgid ""
"Who did what, to what, when and from where: every file that left the system "
"(DATA_EXPORTED, with its checksum), report runs and files, rule and scenario changes,"
" sign-ins and user administration. Read-only."
msgstr ""
"Tko je što učinio, čemu, kada i odakle: svaka datoteka koja je napustila sustav "
"(DATA_EXPORTED s checksum), pokretanja izvješća i datoteke, promjene "
"pravila/scenarija, prijave i admin korisnika. Samo čitanje."

msgid ""
"Configuration of the product: system, display, processing, storage, database, theme "
"and interfaces."
msgstr "Konfiguracija proizvoda: sustav, prikaz, obrada, pohrana, baza, tema i sučelja."

msgid "Interface Manager"
msgstr "Upravljač sučelja"

msgid ""
"The section of Settings that lists every interface, its domain, what it needs and "
"whether it is switched on."
msgstr "Odjeljak postavki koji navodi svako sučelje, domenu, ovisnosti i je li uključeno."

msgid "Review and manage localized strings across every screen."
msgstr "Pregled i upravljanje lokaliziranim nizovima na svim ekranima."

msgid "Concurrency Monitor"
msgstr "Monitor konkurentnosti"

msgid "Runtime diagnostics: worker threads, resource coordination and pool state."
msgstr "Runtime dijagnostika: radni threadovi, koordinacija resursa i stanje pool-a."

